<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill upgrades Univision.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill upgrades Univision.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded its near-term rating on Univision Communication Inc to accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it kept the long-term rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
